  m_Name: SEM1_CLASS_D06
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LessonQuizData
  kind: 1
  title: "Ki\u1EC3m tra nhanh \u2014 ng\xE0y 6"
  intro: "B\xE0i tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp: c\xE2u h\u1ECFi nhi\u1EC5u nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n.
    Ch\u1ECDn \u0111\xE1p \xE1n ch\u1EB7t ch\u1EBD nh\u1EA5t (ki\u1EC3u event h\xE0i
    h\u01B0\u1EDBc)."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 6] M\u1ED9t h\xE0m f li\xEAn t\u1EE5c tr\xEAn
      [a,b] v\xE0 f(a)f(b)<0. Kh\u1EB3ng \u0111\u1ECBnh n\xE0o \u0111\xFAng (gi\u1EA3
      s\u1EED th\u1EF1c ph\xE2n t\xEDch c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n)?"
    options:
    - "T\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i c\u2208(a,b) sao cho f(c)=0"
    - "f \u0111\u1EA1o h\xE0m m\u1ECDi n\u01A1i"
    - "f l\xE0 \u0111a th\u1EE9c"
    - "f c\xF3 c\u1EF1c \u0111\u1EA1i tuy\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED1i t\u1EA1i a"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 6] N\u1EBFu m\u1ED9t ma vu\xF4ng A kh\u1EA3
      ngh\u1ECBch, ph\xE1t bi\u1EC3u n\xE0o lu\xF4n \u0111\xFAng?"
    options:
    - "det(A) \u2260 0"
    - A^2 = I
    - "A \u0111\u1ED1i x\u1EE9ng"
    - "M\u1ECDi ph\u1EA7n t\u1EED A \u0111\u1EC1u d\u01B0\u01A1ng"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 6] Thu\u1EADt ng\u1EEF 'p-value' (nh\u1EADp
      m\xF4n) g\u1EA7n v\u1EDBi \xFD ngh\u0129a n\xE0o nh\u1EA5t khi di\u1EC5n gi\u1EA3i
      \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n?"
    options:
    - "X\xE1c su\u1EA5t (ho\u1EB7c t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EF1) quan s\xE1t th\u1EA5y
      d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u c\u1EF1c \u0111oan nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy n\u1EBFu gi\u1EA3 thuy\u1EBFt
      null \u0111\xFAng"
    - "X\xE1c su\u1EA5t gi\u1EA3 thuy\u1EBFt null \u0111\xFAng"
    - "\u0110\u1ED9 l\u1EC7ch chu\u1EA9n"
    - "Sai s\u1ED1 \u0111o l\u01B0\u1EDDng tuy\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED1i"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 6] Ch\u1ECDn c\xE2u \u0111\xFAng v\u1EC1 '\u0111\u1ED9
      l\u1EC7ch chu\u1EA9n' m\u1EABu (th\u1ED1ng k\xEA c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n):"
    options:
    - "\u0110\u01A1n v\u1ECB gi\u1ED1ng \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u g\u1ED1c"
    - "Lu\xF4n \xE2m"
    - "B\u1EB1ng ph\u01B0\u01A1ng sai"
    - "Kh\xF4ng nh\u1EA1y v\u1EDBi outliers"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 6] 'Big-O O(n)' th\u01B0\u1EDDng m\xF4 t\u1EA3
      \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "Gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n ti\u1EC7m c\u1EADn t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 t\u0103ng th\u1EDDi
      gian theo k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc input"
    - "B\u1ED9 nh\u1EDB ch\xEDnh x\xE1c t\xEDnh b\u1EB1ng byte"
    - "S\u1ED1 v\xF2ng l\u1EB7p t\u1ED1i \u0111a lu\xF4n = n"
    - "\u0110\u1ED9 ph\u1EE9c t\u1EA1p t\u1ED1i thi\u1EC3u c\u1EE7a m\u1ECDi thu\u1EADt
      to\xE1n"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
